* 18 Oct 26 SD Core for Linux Solo (Solo carry A, owner's ruling B) - NEW.  The rule that was
*           the body of !voc_guard, with the display taken out, so that a caller which cannot
*           display (the API server: its client is not at a terminal) can ask the same question
*           and put the answer in its own error message.  !voc_guard is now this and a display.
